cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use GCEN2, please cite it as below. GCEN2 reimplements methods of
  GCEN, WGCNA and hdWGCNA; please also cite the papers of the methods you use.
title: "GCEN2: a toolkit for gene co-expression network analysis with single-cell resolution"
